<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000/T of soybeans.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000/T of soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan BSPA's Taichung Division will tender on Friday for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans, traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The Taichung Division consists of Sino Japan Feed Corp, Chia Hsin, Formosa Oilseed Fwu Sow Grain and Tay Shan</p>
